# Tolarian Drake (2/4 flying, phasing) wears Rancor (+2/+0) and Skullclamp (+1/-1), both Bot1's. In Bot1's turn 3 untap step it
# phases out (CR 702.26a) and the Aura and the Equipment phase out with it, indirectly (CR 702.26g): all three are off Bot1's
# battlefield and still attached (CR 702.26d). While it is out it can't block (CR 702.26b): Bot2's Wind Drake attacks in turn 4
# and Bot1 has no creature to block with; and Lightning Bolt can't target it. In turn 5 all three phase in, still attached,
# the Drake 5/3. Back in, it is a legal target again: Bot2's Bolt in turn 6 kills it (Skullclamp draws Bot1 two, and Rancor returns to hand: two draw steps, Rancor and two make 5 cards).

